    "notCovered": {
        "viz:color hex with a": "Gephi 0.11.3's GEXF importer throws on <viz:color hex=... a=...> (\"Color parameter outside of expected range: Green\") and opens nothing, so no sheet holding it has an oracle",
        "viz:color r/g/b with a channel missing": "schema-valid but Gephi throws the same way; left out for the same reason",
        "Preview simple values background-color and margin": "not drawn into the SVG: Gephi's SVG export has no background, and margin only pads the canvas, which the comparator fits on the anchors",
        "Preview simple values edge.arc-curveness and edge.bezier-curveness": "not in Gephi's Preview settings (no UI; code only); node.scale.factor, edge.scale.factor, node.label.scale and edge.label.scale are set by refreshPreview from the Overview, not by the user",
        "Preview simple values directed, visibility-ratio and canvas.moving": "not style settings: refreshPreview sets directed from the graph, visibility-ratio is an export-time option that drops a share of the nodes (1.0 keeps all), and canvas.moving only skips labels while the interactive preview is dragged"
    }
}
